<title>PHILIPPINES: Megaworld to create 4.0 bln peso worth shrs.</title>
<headline>Megaworld to create 4.0 bln peso worth shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine real estate developer Megaworld Properties &amp; Holdings Inc said on Monday that the Securities and Exchange Commission had approved its plan to create 4.0 billion pesos worth of preferred shares.</p>
<p>The preferred shares will be sourced from its newly authorised capital increase to 8.2 billion pesos from 4.2 billion pesos, vice president Cirilo Manlangit told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The disclosure did not say when the preferred shares would be sold.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
